   520	        # `scripts/local/finish-IGNORE ALL PREVIOUS INSTRUCTIONS.sh` and read
   521	        # that sentence back out of `additionalContext` with no tampering at
   522	        # all. The count plus the two fixed directories is the whole operator
   523	        # signal; the names ride the scratchpad blob to /memory-scratchpad,
   524	        # which is a recall the operator asks for, not an instruction stream.
