   567	                "NOTE: the continuity snapshot is >12h old — it may be a prior "
   568	                "session's; verify the plan state before relying on the unit pointer."
   569	            )
   570	        # PLAN-179 W0/W1 cross-file pass: name the store the snapshot is
   571	        # ACTUALLY in. The blob carries `scope_kind` (stamped by the PreCompact
   572	        # half via scratchpad_lib.stamp_scope_kind) precisely so this line does
   573	        # not have to guess — and it used to guess wrong: every session-scope
