    24	   answered STAT-ONLY (`st_mtime` vs the session-start anchor), one
    25	   `session_memory_delta_observed` event + one operator line. The hook
    26	   NEVER writes memory and never opens a memory file for write: memory
    27	   writing stays a decision of the model or the Owner — this rail makes
