   675	    """The progress-guard floor in tokens, or None when the guard is OFF.
   676	
   677	    PLAN-179 W0 US2b. Read from ``CEO_CONTEXT_PROGRESS_FLOOR_TOKENS``; there is
   678	    deliberately NO default — the plan requires the measured ``F`` before the
   679	    floor has an honest value, so an unset (or non-positive / non-integer) env
   680	    var leaves the guard a no-op instead of shipping a magic number."""
