   908	def _pressure_bucket(used_pct: Optional[int], rungs: Any) -> int:
   909	    """Highest closed rung the observed percent reached, or the 0 sentinel.
   910	
   911	    ``rungs`` is ``audit_emit._CONTEXT_PRESSURE_USED_BUCKETS_PCT`` — passed in
   912	    rather than re-declared so the caller owns the "derive, never recall"
   913	    property. Below the lowest rung (or no measurement at all) returns
   914	    :data:`_PRESSURE_BUCKET_UNKNOWN`, which audit_emit documents as
   915	    "unrecognized / absent bucket" and keeps deliberately outside the enum."""
